### 1. GET All Downloads
GET http://localhost:3000/downloads

### 2. POST Create Download (Sukses - 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/downloads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Tutorial Web Dev 2026",
  "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sample123",
  "format": "mp4-1080",
  "fileSizeMb": 65.5,
  "status": "pending"
}

### 3. POST Create Download (Validasi Gagal - 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:3000/downloads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ab",
  "url": "bukan-url-valid",
  "format": "format-salah"
}

### 4. POST Create Download (ConflictException - 409 URL Duplikat)
POST http://localhost:3000/downloads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Duplikat URL",
  "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ",
  "format": "mp4-720"
}

### 5. GET Find One by ID (Sukses - 200)
GET http://localhost:3000/downloads/1

### 6. GET Find One by ID (NotFoundException - 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/downloads/999

### 7. PATCH Update Download (Sukses - 200)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/downloads/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "selesai",
  "format": "mp4-1080"
}

### 8. DELETE Download (Sukses - 200)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/downloads/1
